{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2022-10-20 16:15:00', 'title': 'CITIGROUP DECLARES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND; CITIGROUP DECLARES PREFERRED DIVIDENDS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CITIGROUP INC. TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON CITIGROUP'S COMMON STOCK OF $0.51 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 23, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 7, 2022."}